  "details": "Qt 3D provides functionality for near-realtime simulation systems with support for 2D and 3D rendering in both Qt C++ and Qt Quick applications).  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * qt3d: qt: arbitrary code execution via out-of-bounds write in Qt3D assimp plugin (CVE-2026-111487)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
